 "name": "Hydrokinesis",
 "type": "feat",
 "img": "modules/jjk5e/icons/techniques/disaster-tides.svg",
 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Tides of Disaster</em></p>\n<p>Through training and understanding, you have found new applications to your water. You gain the one of the following (You can select this feat multiple times):</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Piercing Water:</strong> You make a small water beam made to pierce through enemies. As an action for 2 CE, you make a cursed energy attack against a creature within 30 ft. On a hit, they take 2d10 cold damage + 2d6 piercing damage and are forced to make a Constitution saving throw. On a failure, they are knocked prone and will receive the damage rolled one additional time as a vital organ is hit. On a success, they don't take additional damage and are not prone.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Two water spells below 5th level. The ce cost equals the spell’s level in Cursed Energy.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
   "chat": ""
  },
